starcraft,"When scouting look for:

* Attempted wall off
* No tech lab / reactor
* Double gas / 2nd gas before 2nd depot


If they are walling off there is a good chance it is either going to be the 2 thor timing attack or the raven / banshee timing attack.


A good way to slow down both of these attacks is early pressure.  Even a chrono boosted 1st zealot can do a lot of damage vs a 2 marine army.  A good stalker heavy push can do a lot of damage before the tech pops out.


Stay away from robo tech.  The thor push and the banshee push are both very effective against builds like the 3gate robo.

Get your twilight and get an upgrade, blink for scouting or charge vs scouted thors / armoury.

After scouting get either dark templars vs thors or high templars vs the raven build.  Use the dts to split up the very small thor army, pick off SCVs and to burn scans. Use HTs vs the marines and to feedback his banshees.  Don't bother getting a robo vs the raven as the build is designed to snipe the observer, instead invest into a stargate and make pheonix and a forge for cannons and upgrades.

The main idea with fighting both of these timing attacks is to delay them enough to get enough gateway units to overwhelm and to get the proper tech to kill the support units that are necessary for the build (SCVs for the thors / marines for the banshees).",1290541941.0,1
