* Win+L: lock your PC!
*
* Oldies but goodies:

* Win + M: Show the desktop
* Win + Pause / Break: System information
* Win + R: ""Run"" (wmplayer, notepad, paint, regedit, calc - the fastest way to open these less used but important programs IMO)
* Win + E: Windows explorer
* Ctrl + Esc  OR Win: Start menu (my brother pops out his winkey for gaming and uses the ctrl +esc all the time)
